stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> UNQUALIFIED
  UNQUALIFIED --> COUPON_SCREEN : material batch documented
  COUPON_SCREEN --> CALIBRATED_TEST : density, thickness and sensors pass
  COUPON_SCREEN --> REJECT : defects or batch uncertainty
  CALIBRATED_TEST --> SPECTRUM_TEST : declared spectrum and dosimetry ready
  SPECTRUM_TEST --> AGEING_TEST : transmitted dose and secondary checks pass
  SPECTRUM_TEST --> REFRAME : spectrum-specific failure
  AGEING_TEST --> INTEGRATION_REVIEW : thermal and mechanical checks pass
  AGEING_TEST --> REFRAME : degradation or delamination
  INTEGRATION_REVIEW --> UNQUALIFIED : new geometry or spectrum
  INTEGRATION_REVIEW --> REFRAME : missing independent review
  REFRAME --> UNQUALIFIED
  REJECT --> UNQUALIFIED : corrected batch

